            "review_title": "Review at Kim Restaurant & Coffee",
            "review_text": "Oscardog16\nAdelaide, Australia3345 contributions\n0\nThe Vietnamese pancake was really crispy and delicious.\nAug 2025 • Couples\nWent for lunch and ordered too much food. The Vietnamese pancake for 115 k Dong was huge. They were happy to amend the order to make it with only pork and no seafood. Unfortunately, our order for Vietnamese spring rolls got lost in translation and we ended up with seafood spring rolls. They had unshelled prawns in them, and we think it was served with a fish dipping sauce. Make sure you ask for vegetarian spring rolls.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nUse google translate to request your dietary requirements. No seafood somehow translated to prawns in the spring rolls.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 22, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
